    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aim Camp: The AIM Trainer for Those Who Want to Improve, Not Just Play</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim Camp is designed with a single goal: to improve your accuracy and reaction time in FPS games. If you're looking for a narrative experience or a traditional shooter, this isn't for you. Aim Camp is a technical tool for those who want to be faster, more precise, and deadlier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcc8 <strong>Training, Not Entertainment:</strong><br>Each session is designed to refine your aim, not to entertain with missions or adventures.<br>Perfect for competitive players who want to enhance their performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f <strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete Training:</strong> Tailored modes for various needs:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CQB (Close Quarters Battle) to enhance close-range reactions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precision Shooting to develop pinpoint accuracy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drone Training to master aiming at moving targets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sensory Simulations to sharpen reflexes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chaos System for dynamic, destructible environments.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic Graphics:</strong> An immersive environment replicating realistic training conditions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Advanced Mechanics:</strong> Every shot matters. Every movement improves your muscle memory.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Who It\u2019s For:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Competitive players aiming to improve.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streamers and professionals refining their skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FPS enthusiasts seeking a competitive edge.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t a traditional FPS. It\u2019s serious training for those who mean business. Ready to sharpen your skills? Aim Camp awaits.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aim Camp: The AIM Trainer for Those Who Want to Improve, Not Just Play</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim Camp is designed with a single goal: to improve your accuracy and reaction time in FPS games. If you're looking for a narrative experience or a traditional shooter, this isn't for you. Aim Camp is a technical tool for those who want to be faster, more precise, and deadlier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcc8 <strong>Training, Not Entertainment:</strong><br>Each session is designed to refine your aim, not to entertain with missions or adventures.<br>Perfect for competitive players who want to enhance their performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f <strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete Training:</strong> Tailored modes for various needs:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CQB (Close Quarters Battle) to enhance close-range reactions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precision Shooting to develop pinpoint accuracy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drone Training to master aiming at moving targets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sensory Simulations to sharpen reflexes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chaos System for dynamic, destructible environments.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic Graphics:</strong> An immersive environment replicating realistic training conditions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Advanced Mechanics:</strong> Every shot matters. Every movement improves your muscle memory.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Who It\u2019s For:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Competitive players aiming to improve.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streamers and professionals refining their skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FPS enthusiasts seeking a competitive edge.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t a traditional FPS. It\u2019s serious training for those who mean business. Ready to sharpen your skills? Aim Camp awaits.</p>",
